{
    "id": 135,
    "title": "Communications, the rest as one release (decisions/0167; 0172 steps 3-7)",
    "why": "Jason, 2026-11-18: \"can you have the entire build pushed for one release.\" The email engine (0167): System Configuration → Communications with senders (Check, Send me a test), every cPanel mailbox on every domain (make, suspend, reset; passwords typed or made and written to .env, never shown), routing by kind, SPF/DKIM/DMARC with fixes, message control (pauses, the Sent view on the one route; every Bluehost send now logged), Amazon SES receiving. Pulse: the six levels, flags and tags (Follow up, importance, tags, pin, folders, archive), the bell's colour and list, a message opened in place with its own buttons. Mailboxes read and answered in Pulse (My inbox: ours by IMAP, outside ones by IMAP, POP, Gmail app passwords, Sign in with Microsoft; Google sign-in gated on revenue). Cards: one actions helper, Leave a message on unclaimed listings (held, or sent to the listing's email at its pace, with stop, spam report and the 90-day expiry), Email counted, counts in Sales, the storefront and Marketing cards fixed. The push engine (our own keys, free). Replies on comments with the notice's own Reply/Hide/Report, booking reminders and changes, group posts, join requests and reports. The staff Communications setting. Texting is not in it (its own decision first).",
    "proposals": "decisions/0167; decisions/0172 §6 steps 3-7",
